 * Compact money for dense surfaces and chart ticks: `$12.4k`, `1.2M`.
 *
 * Rounds half-up on the decimal digits, like every other amount. Absent stays
 * the em dash. Charts use this for ticks only — a chart never formats a value
 * it was handed; it receives preformatted labels.
 */
